  <div class="hu-read-body">

    <section class="hu-read-section" id="start">
      <p class="hu-read-p">The first commit went in on March 31. One page, a logo, and a netlify.toml I edited four times the
      next morning because the site would not deploy and I did not know why yet.</p>
      <p class="hu-read-p">Tonight I went through every page on the site, once at night and once in day, and left a note on
      most of them. That review is where I'm drawing the line for 1.0.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="hu-read-section" id="numbers">
      <div class="hu-read-kicker">Where it stands</div>
      <h2 class="hu-read-h2">Version 1.0 by the numbers</h2>
      <div class="hu-stats" style="margin:4px 0 22px">
        <div class="hu-stat"><div class="v">60</div><div class="k">live pages</div></div>
        <div class="hu-stat"><div class="v">8</div><div class="k">tools</div></div>
